sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant App as Ticket App
    participant S as Entrance Scanner
    participant TS as Ticket Service
    participant OC as Occupancy Counter

    V->>App: Open digital ticket
    App-->>V: Display QR code
    V->>S: Scan QR code
    S->>TS: ValidateTicket(ticketId, now)

    alt Early Arrival
        TS-->>S: Reject: Time slot not started
        S-->>V: Display: Too early, wait for slot
    else Already Used
        TS-->>S: Reject: Ticket already redeemed
        S-->>V: Display: Already used, entry denied
    else Valid Ticket
        TS->>TS: Atomically mark redeemed
        TS-->>S: Approve: Entry permitted
        S-->>V: Display: Welcome, turnstile opens

        par Record Attendance
            S->>TS: LogEntryAudit(ticketId, gateId, time)
        and Update Occupancy
            S->>OC: IncrementCount()
            OC-->>S: Current count updated
        end
    end

    opt Re-scan Attempt
        V->>S: Scan same QR code again
        S->>TS: ValidateTicket(ticketId, now)
        TS-->>S: Reject: Ticket already redeemed
        S-->>V: Display: Denied, already scanned
    end
